Domain Entity EducationServiceCenter based on EducationOrganization
    documentation 'This entity represents a regional, multi-services public agency authorized by 
                  'state law to develop, manage and provide services, programs, or other support 
                  'options (e.g., construction, food services, and technology services) to LEAs.
    integer EducationServiceCenterId
        documentation 'The identifier assigned to an education service center by the State Education 
                      'Agency (SEA).
        renames identity property EducationOrganizationId
        is queryable field
    reference StateEducationAgency
        documentation 'The SEA of which the ESC is an organizational component.
        is optional